{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:44:02.013Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"24ccc6377dc2545a091afd4218f23a0b61192a1c1b751439350e51f82adc6bb2","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, from Moss's Strategic digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account before. The change happened on 2026-05-04. The 5/3 digest said it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says the reassignment was effective that day.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day, though earlier digests already call it Gideon's fleet account. So don't put a handover date for Mobility on the slide.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, per the 9/30 digest (\"Gideon's medical account\"). The 3/2025 digest had it as Nadia's. The digests don't say when it moved, so I have no date for that.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner. They only call it the pod's retail/outdoor account. Nadia is hosting a QFO training session, which suggests she's involved, but that isn't confirmation. Please check this one with Nadia or the CRM before it goes on the slide.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:44:06.073Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5e72d48f80908c546708e141006ca642f7913d5da3f3fbe1b8b997def609d3f5","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied in the #strategic-pod thread. The Quillfeather owner isn't in the digests, so that one is still open.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato, who took it over from Nadia Fennimore. It changed hands on 2026-05-04. The 5/3 digest says \"changes hands tomorrow\" and the 5/4 digest says the reassignment was effective that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" that day, but older digests already call it his fleet account. I'd leave the Mobility handover date off the slide.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, per the 9/30 digest (\"Gideon's medical account\"). The March 2025 digest had it as Nadia's, and none of the digests give the date it moved.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests only call it the pod's retail/outdoor account. Nadia is hosting its training session, but that doesn't confirm she owns it. I told Ruth to check with Nadia or the CRM."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
